OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMany inland areas seeing dense
OL,6,Ffog to start Tuesday, this lingering
OL,7,Ffor some. Rain and cloud moving into
OL,8,Fsouthern areas in the morning and
OL,9,Fspreading across Wales by the evening.
OL,10,FBreezy along coasts and over hills.
OL,11,FFeeling chilly.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRemaining damp and cloudy
OL,14,Fovernight, with rain steadily easing
OL,15,Fby morning. Breezy in the far south
OL,16,Fbut a milder night than Monday night
OL,17,Ffor most.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
