OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FAfter a wet and cloudy
OL,6,Fstart, turning drier and brighter for
OL,7,Fmost, with some low cloud lingering in
OL,8,Fcentral areas. Temperatures near
OL,9,Faverage but turning colder overnight
OL,10,Fwith a frost.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FIsolated mist and fog patches to start
OL,14,FThursday, but dry and bright through
OL,15,Fto the weekend, with the odd shower in
OL,16,Fwestern areas Friday. Feeling colder
OL,17,Fwith brisk winds initially.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
